{"id":"wb-7-651","name":"罗盘嘴墓群","retrievedAt":"2026-11-06T11:54:03+00:00","status":"ready","title":"羅盤嘴墓群","text":"罗盘嘴墓群是位于中华人民共和国四川省泸州市泸县奇峰镇的墓群，位于该地红木村9组罗盘山南侧，文物年代为宋。2002年12月27日公布为四川省第六批省级文物保护单位。2013年3月5日列为第七批全国重点文物保护单位。","shortened":false,"sourceUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/wiki/%E7%BE%85%E7%9B%A4%E5%98%B4%E5%A2%93%E7%BE%A4","revisionId":86577019,"revisionUrl":"https://zh.wikipedia.org/w/index.php?oldid=86577019","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0/","authors":"维基百科贡献者","matchEvidence":"名称与地理坐标一致","image":{"path":"assets/wikipedia/c16ab061f55f7828eb73550d.jpg","title":"罗盘嘴墓群.jpg","sourceUrl":"https://commons.wikimedia.org/wiki/File:%E7%BD%97%E7%9B%98%E5%98%B4%E5%A2%93%E7%BE%A4.jpg","originalUrl":"https://upload.wikimedia.org/wikipedia/commons/1/1e/%E7%BD%97%E7%9B%98%E5%98%B4%E5%A2%93%E7%BE%A4.jpg?utm_source=commons.wikimedia.org&utm_campaign=imageinfo&utm_content=original","author":"Nekitarc","license":"CC BY-SA 4.0","licenseUrl":"https://creativecommons.org/licenses/by-sa/4.0","caption":"Luopanzui Cemetery of Song Dynasty at Luxian County","width":320,"height":213}}